      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fb4c1c47992a302d",
      "translationZh": "对 qwen3.8 的 xhigh、medium 模式以及 muse glimmer 做了基准测试。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52d10e9087874da1",
      "translationZh": "qwen3.8 的 Xhigh 推理投入模式耗时将近 30 小时。（而且由于 32K 输出 token 上限，仍有 16 个案例失败）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "350d74d9de3bdfbc",
      "translationZh": "Medium 推理投入模式和 muse glimmer 各自耗时 3-4 小时。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "52005dd000f44cbe",
      "translationZh": "不过，muse glimmer 的结果确实让我惊讶，它的表现比 qwen 更好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d35292e7fbd8ddc",
      "translationZh": "这些基准测试考察的是模型的隐式知识，这对较小的模型有点不公平，但加上 RAG，我相信它们就能与前沿模型相当。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af224527d17dd353",
      "translationZh": "claude 模型的结果是我直接从 ecro 的 embedeval 仓库中取来的。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4cf3ba25d485368",
      "translationZh": "我并不是在这里贬低 qwen，我喜欢 qwen 的思考方式，以及它给出的更好结果。我知道，有了更多上下文和 RAG，qwen 会表现得更好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "96df29937825ec7b",
      "translationZh": "我只是在这里表达对 muse 的欣赏，因为我觉得它被低估了。它的优势在于，滑动窗口带来了高效的 kv cache，从而可以让你获得更大的上下文窗口。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
